<%- include('partials/header') %>

<style>
  :root {
    --faq-primary: #2874f0;
    --faq-primary-hover: #1d4ed8;
    --faq-primary-subtle: rgba(40, 116, 240, 0.08);
    --faq-dark: #0f172a;
    --faq-muted: #64748b;
  }

  /* Hero Section & Animations (Matches Music, Blog, & About Page Heroes) */
  @keyframes gradientShift {
    0% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
    50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }
    100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
  }

  @keyframes pulseGlow {
    0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.8; }
    50% { transform: scale(1.2); opacity: 1; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.7); }
  }

  .faq-hero {
    padding: 85px 16px 28px !important;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08) 0%, transparent 65%), #f8fafc;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
    position: relative;
  }

  .hero-faq-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08);
    border-radius: 50px;
    padding: 5px 14px;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1e40af;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .pulse-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #2563eb;
    animation: pulseGlow 1.8s infinite ease-in-out;
  }

  .animated-2am-title {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #0f172a;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .gradient-2am-text {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb 0%, #7c3aed 45%, #ec4899 75%, #2563eb 100%);
    background-size: 300% 300%;
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    animation: gradientShift 5s ease infinite;
  }

  .faq-subtitle {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: #64748b;
    max-width: 660px;
    margin: 0 auto 20px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .faq-search-wrap {
    max-width: 580px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    position: relative;
  }

  .faq-search-input {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 13px 20px 13px 48px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12);
    background: #ffffff;
    color: #0f172a;
    font-size: 15px;
    outline: none;
    transition: all 0.25s;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
  }

  .faq-search-input::placeholder { color: #94a3b8; }

  .faq-search-input:focus {
    background: #ffffff;
    border-color: #2563eb;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.15);
  }

  .faq-search-icon {
    position: absolute;
    left: 18px;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .animated-2am-title {
      font-size: 1.65rem;
    }
  }

  /* Filter Navigation */
  .faq-filter-bar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin: 40px 0 30px;
  }

  .faq-filter-btn {
    padding: 9px 18px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--faq-muted);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .faq-filter-btn:hover {
    background: #f8fafc;
    color: var(--faq-dark);
    border-color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .faq-filter-btn.active {
    background: var(--faq-primary);
    color: #fff;
    border-color: var(--faq-primary);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(40, 116, 240, 0.25);
  }

  /* Accordion Styling */
  .faq-container {
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .faq-category-section {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .faq-category-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #f1f5f9;
  }

  .faq-category-icon {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--faq-primary-subtle);
    color: var(--faq-primary);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .faq-category-title {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--faq-dark);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .faq-item {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }

  .faq-item:hover {
    border-color: #cbd5e1;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
  }

  .faq-item.active {
    border-color: #93c5fd;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(40, 116, 240, 0.08);
  }

  .faq-question {
    padding: 20px 24px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--faq-dark);
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .faq-toggle-icon {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #f1f5f9;
    color: var(--faq-muted);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    transition: transform 0.25s, background 0.25s, color 0.25s;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .faq-item.active .faq-toggle-icon {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
    background: var(--faq-primary);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .faq-answer {
    padding: 0 24px 22px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #475569;
    display: none;
  }

  .faq-answer p { margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .faq-answer p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .faq-answer ul {
    margin: 10px 0 12px;
    padding-left: 24px;
  }

  .faq-answer li { margin-bottom: 6px; }

  .faq-highlight-box {
    background: #f0fdf4;
    border-left: 4px solid #22c55e;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0;
    margin: 12px 0 4px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #166534;
  }

  /* Support Card */
  .faq-cta-card {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a 0%, #2563eb 100%);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 40px;
    color: #fff;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 50px 0 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2);
  }

  .faq-cta-title {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .faq-cta-desc {
    color: #bfdbfe;
    font-size: 15px;
    max-width: 540px;
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
  }

  .no-faq-results {
    display: none;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 60px 20px;
    color: var(--faq-muted);
  }
</style>

<!-- Hero Section (Matches Music & Blog Hero) -->
<section class="faq-hero text-center">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-faq-badge">
      <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
      <span>2 AM Study Student Helpdesk</span>
      <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-question text-primary ms-1"></i>
    </div>
    
    <h1 class="animated-2am-title">
      <span class="gradient-2am-text">2 AM Study</span> FAQs &amp; Support Hub
    </h1>
    
    <p class="faq-subtitle">
      Get clear answers to your late-night study routines, focus techniques, store essentials &amp; student safety questions.
    </p>

    <div class="faq-search-wrap">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass faq-search-icon"></i>
      <input type="text" id="faqSearchInput" class="faq-search-input" placeholder="Search questions by keyword, topic, or exam..." oninput="filterFaqs()">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Filter Category Pills -->
<main class="container py-4">
  <div class="faq-filter-bar">
    <button class="faq-filter-btn active" onclick="setFaqCategory('all', this)">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group"></i> All Questions
    </button>
    <button class="faq-filter-btn" onclick="setFaqCategory('academics', this)">
      🎓 Academics &amp; Focus
    </button>
    <button class="faq-filter-btn" onclick="setFaqCategory('tools', this)">
      ⚡ Study Tools
    </button>
    <button class="faq-filter-btn" onclick="setFaqCategory('store', this)">
      🛍️ Store &amp; Essentials
    </button>
    <button class="faq-filter-btn" onclick="setFaqCategory('safety', this)">
      🛡️ Student Safety
    </button>
    <button class="faq-filter-btn" onclick="setFaqCategory('mentorship', this)">
      🤝 Mentorship
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-container">
    <!-- Category 1: Academics & Focus -->
    <div class="faq-category-section" data-cat="academics">
      <div class="faq-category-header">
        <div class="faq-category-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i></div>
        <h2 class="faq-category-title">Academics &amp; Study Strategies</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <span>How do I overcome fatigue and stay focused during late-night study sessions?</span>
          <div class="faq-toggle-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Studying late at night (especially around 2 AM) is powerful because the world goes quiet and notifications stop. However, maintaining high focus requires a disciplined physical protocol:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Directional Lighting:</strong> Keep a warm, focused desk lamp right over your books instead of glaring overhead white LEDs.</li>
            <li><strong>Hydration Over Sugar:</strong> Drink cold water steadily. High-sugar snacks cause insulin spikes followed by severe energy crashes.</li>
            <li><strong>50/10 Focus Intervals:</strong> Study intensely for 50 minutes, then do light physical stretches away from screens for 10 minutes.</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="faq-highlight-box">
            <strong>Pro Tip:</strong> If your eyes feel strained, splash cold water and do 2 minutes of box-breathing to reset cognitive alertness.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <span>What is the best strategy for the final 7 days before semester or competitive exams?</span>
          <div class="faq-toggle-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>In the final 7 days, your goal is <strong>retrieval practice</strong> rather than passive reading. Never start brand-new heavy chapters that create panic.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Solve PYQs Under Timed Conditions:</strong> Treat mock papers like the real examination.</li>
            <li><strong>Active Recall Sheets:</strong> Write down core formulas, diagrams, and definitions from memory onto blank paper.</li>
            <li><strong>Protect Your Sleep:</strong> Get at least 6.5–7 hours of sleep; memory consolidation occurs primarily during deep REM cycles.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <span>How can I break my smartphone addiction while studying?</span>
          <div class="faq-toggle-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Willpower alone fails against algorithms designed to hijack attention. You need <strong>environmental friction</strong>:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Place your smartphone in another room or inside a drawer before you begin your study session.</li>
            <li>Use the 2 AM Study Distraction Blocker and fullscreen timer to anchor your workstation.</li>
            <li>Schedule 15 minutes of guilt-free phone time only AFTER completing 3 full study blocks.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Category 2: Study Tools -->
