      <div class="faq-category-header">
        <div class="faq-category-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i></div>
        <h2 class="faq-category-title">Student-First Productivity Tools</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <span>Are the 2 AM Study digital tools, timers, and revision notes free?</span>
          <div class="faq-toggle-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p><strong>Yes, 100% free!</strong> Our core mission is student empowerment. All web tools—including the Pomodoro Timer, Syllabus Tracker, Exam Countdown, Notes Hub, Calculators, LoFi Music, and PDF Tools—are accessible to every student without any mandatory paywalls.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <span>How does the Study Streak &amp; Habit Tracker help me build consistency?</span>
          <div class="faq-toggle-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>The Streak Tracker provides visual reinforcement for every daily study milestone you achieve. Building a visible chain of uninterrupted study days creates psychological momentum, making it significantly harder to skip sessions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <span>How can I download subject revision notes and formulas?</span>
          <div class="faq-toggle-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Head over to our <a href="/notes" class="fw-bold text-primary">Notes Hub</a> or the <a href="/resources" class="fw-bold text-primary">Exam Resource Center</a> to browse chapter-wise summaries, handwritten mind maps, and past year question compilations.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Category 3: Store & Essentials -->
    <div class="faq-category-section" data-cat="store">
      <div class="faq-category-header">
        <div class="faq-category-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-store"></i></div>
        <h2 class="faq-category-title">2 AM Study Store &amp; Essentials</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <span>What makes 2 AM Study notebooks and accessories unique?</span>
          <div class="faq-toggle-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Every product in the <strong>2 AM Study Store</strong> is thoughtfully designed for intense academic life:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>80–100 GSM Non-Bleed Paper:</strong> Perfect for fountain pens, gel inks, and highlighters.</li>
            <li><strong>Lay-Flat Spiral &amp; Hardcover Bindings:</strong> Lies 180° flat on cramped library desks.</li>
            <li><strong>Insulated Stainless Steel Bottles:</strong> Keeps water icy cold during long night study sprints.</li>
